[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0010","text":"恶魔，都会做什么……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0020","text":"哇，坏事……\n——坏事，是指……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0030","text":"吃掉小奈的零食……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0040","text":"布丁啊、冰淇淋啊……\n啊，还有……豆沙包什么的……巧克力什么的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0050","text":"……呜……\n好想吃……甜的东西了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0060","text":"……啊……\n有布丁……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0070","text":"这、这是谁的呢……\n名字……没写……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0090","text":"甜花，是坏孩子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11500100_01_0100","text":"甜花，是恶魔……——"}]
